"""
NEXORA CYBER™
Independent Cybersecurity Intelligence & Operations OS
Phase 1 — Cyber Core Foundation

Scope
-----
1. Versioned Cyber contracts
2. Tenant context and isolation primitives
3. Canonical cyber event model
4. Provenance and evidence references
5. Tamper-evident hash-chained audit ledger
6. Thread-safe event bus
7. Event idempotency
8. Agent identity/capability foundation
9. Policy decision foundation
10. Emergency-stop foundation
11. Deterministic JSON serialization
12. Built-in deterministic self-tests

IMPORTANT
---------
This module is intentionally independent from NEXORA Business OS.

It must NOT import:
- NEXORA Business OS modules
- Business OS database code
- Business OS authentication
- Business OS APIs
- Business OS runtime state

No external vendor credentials or external cyber actions are fabricated here.

Python: 3.10+
Runtime dependencies: Python standard library only
"""

