"""
NEXORA CYBER™
PHASE 3 — CYBER DATA FABRIC + CONNECTOR INFRASTRUCTURE

Purpose
-------
Independent Cybersecurity data-fabric implementation.

Pipeline
--------
COLLECT
  -> VALIDATE
  -> NORMALIZE
  -> DEDUPLICATE
  -> ENRICH
  -> ENTITY_RESOLVE
  -> CONTEXTUALIZE
  -> CORRELATE
  -> STORE
  -> INDEX
  -> DETECT
  -> EMIT

Design principles
-----------------
- No dependency on NEXORA Business OS.
- Tenant isolation is mandatory.
- Unsupported connector capabilities are explicit.
- No fake third-party execution.
- Idempotent ingestion.
- Dead-letter handling.
- Replay-safe processing.
- Immutable provenance metadata.
- Versioned schemas.
- Deterministic record identity.
- Thread-safe registry/event publication.
- SQLite backend is development/local durable storage only.
- Production horizontal scale requires external PostgreSQL,
  Redis/queue/event infrastructure and must be separately validated.

Python: 3.10+
"""

