"""
NEXORA CYBER™ — PHASE 27
EXTRACTED FOUNDATION BOUNDARY & CYBER INDEPENDENCE

Purpose
-------
Phase 27 establishes the clean architectural boundary between:

    Extracted Foundation / Reference Patterns
                         ↓
                  Cyber Adapters
                         ↓
                  NEXORA CYBER

The extracted material is reference-only.

This module does NOT:
    - import Business OS runtime code
    - implement Business OS logic
    - duplicate Business OS engines
    - implement future Cyber phases
    - silently trust external foundation code

It provides:
    - Cyber-owned boundary contracts
    - reference metadata
    - safe adapter contracts
    - dependency boundary validation
    - forbidden import detection
    - Business-logic contamination detection
    - module ownership checks
    - runtime isolation checks
    - architecture conformance validation
    - boundary audit
    - self-tests
"""

